{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影がありました〜\nううう、疲れましたヽ(；；)丿\nはい。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて\n乃木ここ\nまたうpされました━━━━(゜∀゜)━━━!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、たくさんの投票\nほんとにありがとうございます┏○┓\nよだれ晒したかいあったわ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、まだ油断はできないので！\n引き続き投票していただきたいです。\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンに手作りで何作ってたの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/03/7573791/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑これ！一昨年作ったやつー\nアイシングクッキー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きな鍋は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n豆乳鍋かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装したことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nないと思う(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"注射平気？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n針はまだいいんだけど、血を見たくない＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝寒いけど起きれる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n起きれるよ！（￣＾￣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貼るカイロはお腹派？背中派？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n背中！寒すぎるときは全身のあちこちに貼る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事の話なんだけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『白竹堂』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親戚なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、中田に白竹堂の扇子を\nプレゼントとかしなくていいのよー\n自分で使ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/03/7573791/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでて「あれ？」って思ったけど\n親戚だ、って\n書いたつもりで書き忘れちゃってたみたい(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/03/7573791/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/03/7573791/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(´-ω-｀)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}